.edu.tw/login/portal） 3.上課時間：每週三14:00-17:00。4.本課程學生具備基本程式設計能力、具備基本Web 技術（HTML/CSS/JS）與GitHub使用經驗、對雲端服務有初步認識者佳（不為必要條件）。","tags":[],"english":false},{"url":"https://selcrs.nsysu.edu.tw/menu5/showoutline.asp?SYEAR=114&SEM=2&CrsDat=AI50014&Crsname=生成式AI的人文導論","change":null,"changeDescription":null,"multipleCompulsory":false,"department":"AI聯盟(碩)","id":"AI50014","grade":"0","class":"不分班","name":"生成式AI的人文導論\nINTRODUCING GENERATIVE AI FOR HUMANITIES","credit":"3","yearSemester":"期","compulsory":false,"restrict":10,"select":0,"selected":0,"remaining":10,"teacher":"AI聯盟教師","room":"五3,4,B(同步遠距)","classTime":["","","","","34B","",""],"description":"《不調查》\n1.開課單位及教師：臺灣大學謝舒凱老師。本校協助教師：中文系羅景文副教授。 2.此為同步遠距課程，請使用台大數位學習平台NTUCOOL（http://cool.ntu.edu.tw/login/portal）。3.上課時間：每週五 10:20-13:10。4.本課程的作業與練習，從傳統偏重工程或程式碼的細節，轉向以直覺、風格和語義驅動的「Vibe Coding」實踐。不具備 python程式知識亦可。但是要具有開放、樂於學習新事物的精神與毅力，才能有所收穫。","tags":[],"english":false},{"url":"https://selcrs.nsysu.edu.tw/menu5/showoutline.asp?SYEAR=114&SEM=2&CrsDat=PHY104&Crsname=普通物理學（二）","change":null,"changeDescription":null,"multipleCompulsory":false,"department":"普通物理小組","id":"PHY104","grade":"1","class":"不分班","name":"普通物理學（二）\nGENERAL PHYSICS (II)","credit":"3","yearSemester":"期","compulsory":true,"restrict":50,"select":0,"selected":0,"remaining":50,"teacher":"陳易馨","room":"一3,4(理SC 0008) 三5(理SC 0008)","classTime":["34","","5","","","",""],"description":"《講授類》\n本課程與普通物理學演習(二)一起規劃課程, 需與普通物理學演習(二)一起修習","tags":[],"english":false},{"url":"https://selcrs.nsysu.edu.tw/menu5/showoutline.asp?SYEAR=114&SEM=2&CrsDat=PHY105&Crsname=普通物理（二）","change":null,"changeDescription":null,"multipleCompulsory":false,"department":"普通物理小組","id":"PHY105","grade":"1","class":"不分班","name":"普通物理（二）\nGENERAL PHYSICS (II)","credit":"3","yearSemester":"期","compulsory":true,"restrict":70,"select":0,"selected":0,"remaining":70,"teacher":"周雄","room":"三5,6,7(工EN 4055-1)","classTime":["","","567","","","",""],"description":"《講授類》\n化學系與機電系一年級學生優先選修，本課程無法抵免英語專班普通物理","tags":[],"english